OL,3,AUS road rage killer's sentence quashed
OL,4,Abecause AI video of victim was shown in
OL,5,Acourt
OL,6,
OL,7,FAn Arizona road rage killer will be
OL,8,Fresentenced after an appeals court
OL,9,Fruled that an AI-generated video
OL,10,Fmessage from his dead victim was
OL,11,Fimproperly aired in court.
OL,13,FGabriel Paul Horcasitas was found
OL,14,Fguilty by a jury of shooting and
OL,15,Fkilling Christopher Pelkey, 37, during
OL,16,Fa confrontation at a red light in 2021.
OL,17,FHe was sentenced to 10 years behind
OL,18,Fbars.
OL,23,APub: 02-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB Nat NewsC Nat TVF Clean Feed
FL,320,300,200,140,0,100
