OL,3,AUS road rage killer's sentence quashed
OL,4,Abecause AI video of victim was shown in
OL,5,Acourt
OL,6,
OL,7,FBut his legal team appealed, arguing
OL,8,Fthat the trial judge should not have
OL,9,Fallowed an AI video, created by
OL,10,FPelkey's family, to be shown in court
OL,11,Fahead of last year's sentencing.
OL,13,FThe Arizona Court of Appeals agreed,
OL,14,Fruling that Horcasitas, 55, must be
OL,15,Fresentenced because the AI clip
OL,16,F"crossed that line".
OL,23,APub: 02-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG2/2
